  "title": "Nourishing Bitter Spanish Navy Beans Patatas Bravas",
  "description": "A hearty one pot Spanish dish featuring dried white navy beans and patatas bravas, cooked to perfection on a cedar plank. This nut free friendly recipe is perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
