  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the soaked navy beans and set them aside.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, garlic, and onion to the pot and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the tomato paste to the pot and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, navy beans, potatoes, salt, and black pepper to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Transfer the pot to a cedar plank and cook for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the patatas bravas hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
